    "title": "Zombie Sniper War 3 - Fire FPS",
    "description": "Pick up your gun; the zombie war sniper adventure is here! Kill zombie horde in this FPS gun fire shooting game. With a large variety of guns and sniper rifles to help you survive the war in the zombie infested world.\r\n\r\nAre you ready for a hot nonstop action packed zombie shooting FPS game? With easy controls and fast-paced action. Hunting and fighting evil dead zombies has never been more fun and adrenaline-pumping!\r\n\r\nZombie Sniper War 3 is an offline game with realistic 3D graphics. Experience a thrilling, heart pounding fun story campaign. Use your sniper rifle to fire and assassinate your dead target like a hitman and survive dangerous boss fights with your strongest gun.\r\n\r\n[The world of Zombie Sniper War]\r\nIn the quest for knowledge and advancement, scientists pushed the boundaries of exploration, embarking on expeditions to study the mysteries of the undiscovered frontier. In the process, they accidentally created and released the zombie virus! You're now stuck in a world of war where you have to shoot to survive!\r\n\r\nGame features of Zombie Sniper War 3 - Fire FPS\r\n\r\n[Story campaign that'll give you a nightmare!]\r\nFight and kill for survival against zombies, ghouls, mummies, undead soldiers, mutant dogs, fire birds, and other kinds of monsters! Your journey will start in an apocalyptic city and continue through uncharted deserts, wild frontier dark horror forests, ancient mysterious tombs, and high technological labs.\r\n\r\n[Sniper shooter combat game]\r\nBecome the ultimate sniper hitman, a monster hunter shooter, or an infamous deadly assassin. Arm yourself with a legendary sniper rifle and assassinate targets from far distances.\r\n\r\n[Mercenary hitman contracts]\r\nCan you take out an invasion of infected zombies in time? Or perhaps find and shoot all the evil monsters on a battlefield of war! Accept missions from an arms dealer to earn extra cash. Challenge yourself and pick the nightmare missions to win and earn even greater prizes.\r\n\r\n[Defense is the best offensive strategy]\r\nSurvive the zombie horde in action filled first person. Kill endless waves of zombies with machine gun, assault rifle, revolver, modern weapon, sniper rifle, or shotgun. Fire in the hole!\r\n\r\nExperience action packed adventure in over 150 story missions across 5 different nightmare regions with epic boss fights. With new content added all the time!\r\n\r\nThe last frontier between humans and zombies is the battleground in this relentless war. In this post-apocalyptic world, survivors navigate the dangerous frontier between life and death, constantly on the lookout for zombie threats.\r\n\r\nGet ready to challenge other players in the events to prove who is the best and the ultimate shooter!\r\n\r\nThis is your call of duty to save humanity. Join the last of us and fight against the zombie apocalypse in this free-to-play offline war game! Let the walking dead come; guns are loaded; pull the trigger and shoot to kill!\r\n\r\nEnjoy!",
